# Gatherings client import safety

`src/lib/gatherings.js` is **server-only** (it imports `permissions.js` → `server-auth.js`). Importing it from client pages/components crashes the browser with a client-side exception when env vars are missing.

## Do

- Import time/phase helpers from `src/lib/gathering-phase.js`
- Import tags/districts/calendar helpers from their own client-safe modules
- Keep API routes using `src/lib/gatherings.js`

## Do not

- `import … from '…/lib/gatherings.js'` in `src/components/gatherings/*` or `src/pages/gatherings/*`
- Pull `permissions.js`, `server-auth.js`, or other DB/admin clients into client bundles
